  "question": {
    "text": "Two projectile thrown at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with the horizontal respectively, reach the maximum height in same time. The ratio of their initial velocities is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Time taken to reach maximum height is given by&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math>, where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi></math>&nbsp;is initial velocity.</p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
